msgstr "Kopieren"

msgid "Already installed? Start the service:"
msgstr "Schon installiert? Dienst starten:"

msgid "Trying port %1. Change in widget settings if different."
msgstr ""
"Versuche Port %1. Falls er anders ist, in den Widget-Einstellungen ändern."

msgid ""
"Whether the laptop is running on AC power or battery. Power profiles below "
"can be configured separately for each."
msgstr ""
"Ob der Laptop am Netzteil oder am Akku läuft. Die Energieprofile unten "
"lassen sich für beides getrennt einstellen."

msgid "TDP:"
msgstr "TDP:"

msgid ""
"Thermal Design Power: the sustained power budget the CPU is allowed to draw. "
"Lower means cooler and quieter but less performance; higher means the "
"opposite."
msgstr ""
"Thermal Design Power: die Leistung, die die CPU dauerhaft aufnehmen darf. "
"Weniger heißt kühler und leiser, aber langsamer; mehr heißt das Gegenteil."

msgid "Thermal:"
msgstr "Temperaturgrenze:"

msgid "EPP:"
msgstr "EPP:"

msgid ""
"Energy Performance Preference: biases the CPU scheduler toward power savings "
"or performance within the current frequency/TDP limits, without changing "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Energy Performance Preference: gewichtet die CPU-Steuerung innerhalb der "
"aktuellen Frequenz- und TDP-Grenzen in Richtung Energiesparen oder Leistung, "
"ohne diese Grenzen zu ändern."

msgid "Governor:"
msgstr "Governor:"

msgid ""
"The kernel's CPU frequency governor - the policy deciding how quickly clock "
"speed ramps up and down in response to load (e.g. schedutil, performance, "
"powersave)."
msgstr ""
"Der CPU-Frequenz-Governor des Kernels: die Regel, wie schnell der Takt bei "
"Last steigt und wieder fällt (z. B. schedutil, performance, powersave)."

msgid "Frequency:"
msgstr "Frequenz:"

